# Raw Stream Deck backups contain usernames, local paths and project names.
# Only sanitized profiles in profiles/ may be committed (see docs/sanitizing-checklist.md).
*.streamDeckProfilesBackup
*.streamDeckProfile
!profiles/**/*.streamDeckProfile

# Local-only notes, unpacked backups, scratch
_local/
scratch/
*.log

# Blog lives in a separate PRIVATE repo; never commit it publicly
blog/
CLAUDE.local.md

# OS
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
Releases/
